# OpenPGP armor and detached signatures are frozen evidence bytes. Do not let
# platform line-ending conversion change their published SHA-256 receipts.
*.asc binary

# The social cards carry their provenance stamp in the JPEG's own comment
# marker, and provenance/HERO_PLATE_PROVENANCE.md publishes its SHA-256. Git
# detects these as binary on its own; saying so is one line and removes the
# question on a platform configured to convert line endings.
*.jpg binary
